{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Fresh plan review BLOCKed on a valid G6 mismatch: the old text implied project criteria entered both round_a and round_b. Remediated to the landed contract: project LLM criteria fan into round_a exactly once and are never injected into round_b, whose bounded membership remains escalation/overlay-controlled. Strengthened markers with round_b and project.; clarified one-gate eval resolution and located config errors. Portability advisory deferred because the repository’s canonical Codex verification commands intentionally use this worktree’s POSIX .venv/bin/python path."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785019932142198001,"uuid":"5b285200-a196-4b59-9c56-b11ce93df2a8"}